Package: erhai-debug
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: erhai-device-support (>= 0.1.21~), busybox-static (>= 1:1.36.1), iproute2, bash, systemd, udev, init-system-helpers
Description: Optional USB NCM diagnostics for the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro
 Provides separately supervised DHCP, HTTP and root-shell services on the
 development USB link. Every service requires erhai.debug=1 on the kernel
 command line. Ordinary installed boots leave the channel closed.
 The HTTP server exposes the root filesystem and the shell is unauthenticated;
 this package is intended for explicitly enabled local development sessions.
